  "operative_text": "Section 1 (N.D.C.C. 62.1-02-05(6)): An individual possessing a valid class 1 or class 2 firearm and dangerous weapons license under section 62.1-04-03 may possess a firearm or dangerous weapon at a publicly owned or operated building.\nSection 1 (N.D.C.C. 62.1-02-05(2)(o)): An individual authorized to carry a concealed weapon on school property under section 62.1-02-14."
